            ],
            "Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.": [
                "C\u00e1c phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cung c\u1ea5p cho c\u00e1c b\u1ea3n c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t Pro c\u00f3 gi\u1ea5y ph\u00e9p v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e3 k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd. Sau khi k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tham gia t\u1eeb trang T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n."
            ],
            "Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.": [
                "\u0110\u00e3 l\u01b0u c\u00e1c \u0111i\u1ec3m ng\u1eaft. C\u00e1c trang s\u1ebd \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng chi\u1ec1u r\u1ed9ng m\u1edbi trong l\u1ea7n hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb ti\u1ebfp theo."
